        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nrun_output = await run_command(\"cd workspace/scripts && python summarize_sales.py\")\nprint(run_output)\n\nhas_error = \"Traceback\" in run_output or \"Error\" in run_output\nprint(f\"has_error={has_error}\")\nprint(f\"output_length={len(run_output)}\")\nprint(run_output[:500])\n\nsave_result = await write_file(\"docs/sales_summary.txt\", run_output)\nprint(save_result)\n\nfinal_verify = await read_file(\"docs/sales_summary.txt\")\nprint(final_verify)\n```",
